  "summary": "Rowboat is a desktop AI coworker that indexes work into a local, plain-Markdown knowledge graph and provides work surfaces (email, browser, notes, code mode, meeting notes, apps). Evidence covers product features, MCP tool integration, optional API-key-based services, Google OAuth setup, and a draft proposal on Spaces naming; development-practice guidance appears only in test/QA instructions. Evidence coverage: 150 of 192 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
